-        6.  End primitive [S1, unofficial].
-
-    *   **2.6. Clip Space Transformation**:
-        The geometry shader must transform the final vertex positions to clip space for rasterization.
-        $$ \mathbf{p}_{clip} = \mathbf{M}_{vp} \mathbf{v}' $$
